{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f72727e0-0e49-823d-99e5-ddcbddfbab5d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:02:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Andrade",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:59:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:59:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hey, yeah, hi. Jorge Andrade. I manage a couple of buildings and I'm calling about a water and sewer payment. Sorry, I'm in the stockroom at the hardware store where I work, so the signal's kind of bad back here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:59:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you okay. What's going on with the payment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:00:03-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I sent the payment from the bank, the owner's account, like ten days ago, and I just got a notice from the bank that it bounced. Which, the owner swears there was money in there, and honestly he said that about the roof too, and that was a whole other [line breaks up] anyway. I want to know what the status is. Does it show as paid or not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:00:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out a little at the end there. Let me pull up the account. Do you have the account number handy, or the name on the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:00:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Name is the owner's, it's Andrade Holdings. Yeah, it's a family thing, my uncle. The account number is on a bill in my truck, I can't get it right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:00:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the name will work. [pause] Alright, I see it. The payment came through and then it was reversed, so right now that balance is showing as unpaid again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:00:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So it's unpaid. Wonderful. And does that mean there's a late fee now too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Interest can add on to an overdue balance, yes. There may also be a returned payment charge from the bank side. I'd have to look at the details to say what's on yours, but the balance on the screen is what's owed today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:01:14-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, okay. So, is a payment plan possible? Because it's a big bill, it's way bigger than usual, and he's not going to have it all at once. And that's the other thing, it's so high I think the meter's wrong. Like we had that [inaudible] storm Friday into Saturday, two days ago, and nobody was even home to use water at one of the units, so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:01:35-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. So two things. For a payment plan, that gets set up with our billing office. I can put in a request and have someone call you back to go over the terms. And on the meter, yes, you can ask for a meter test. They check that it's reading accurately, and I can start that request too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:01:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yeah, do both. Is the test free? Because I'm not paying to find out the meter's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:02:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the charge in front of me, and I don't want to quote you something wrong, so the person who calls you back will explain that before anything is scheduled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:02:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. The callback number is four oh one, five five five, zero one eight nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:02:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, zero one eight nine. Got it. And that's Jorge, for Andrade Holdings?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:02:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Just tell them to call after lunch, I'll be out of the stockroom by then and the reception is better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:02:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. I'll note that. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:02:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:02:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Take care, Jorge."
    }
  ],
